e9a b\u1ea1n c\u00f9ng l\u1ee9a, ng\u1ee7 \u1edf b\u1ea5t c\u1ee9 ch\u1ed7 n\u00e0o c\u00f3 s\u00f3ng \u0111i\u1ec7n tho\u1ea1i. C\u1eadu h\u1ecd c\u1ee7a Ng\u1ecdc \u1edf trong Nam, em h\u1ecd c\u1ee7a m\u1eb9, l\u00e0 ng\u01b0\u1eddi \u0111\u1ed3ng t\u00ednh; c\u1eadu v\u1ec1 c\u00f9ng b\u1ea1n \u0111\u1eddi, v\u00e0 \u00f4ng \u0111\u00e3 ghi th\u00eam c\u1ea3 hai c\u00e1i t\u00ean v\u00e0o danh s\u00e1ch ch\u1ee5p \u1ea3nh.`},{`en`:`[[On]] [[the]] [[Friday]] [[of]] [[the]] [[next]] [[week]], [[the]] postman [[brought|bring]] [[a]] [[letter]] [[for]] \`[[Miss]] Tran Ngoc, [[photographer]]\`. [[Her]] [[own]] [[letter]] [[had|have]] [[travelled|travel]] [[to]] [[three]] [[addresses|address]] [[before]] [[it]] [[found|find]] [[Uncle]] Son. \`[[Dear]] Ngoc,\` [[he]] [[wrote|write]], \`[[I]] [[have]] [[read]] [[your]] [[letter]] [[ten]] [[times|time]]. [[I]] [[thought]] [[nobody]] [[in]] [[that]] [[house]] [[wanted|want]] [[to]] [[hear]] [[my]] [[name]]. [[The]] [[kind]] [[girl]] [[from]] [[the]] [[mountains|mountain]] [[is|be]] [[now]] [[my]] [[wife]]; [[our]] [[romance]] [[has|have]] [[lasted|last]] [[eleven]] [[years|year]]. Hung [[was|be]] [[never]] [[only]] [[my]] [[sibling]]; [[he]] [[was|be]] [[my]] [[best]] [[mate]]. [[I]] can't [[promise]] [[anything]]. [[But]] [[keep]] [[the]] [[empty]] [[place]], [[if]] [[you]] [[can]].\``,`vn`:`Th\u1ee9 S\u00e1u tu\u1ea7n sau \u0111\u00f3, b\u00e1c \u0111\u01b0a th\u01b0 mang t\u1edbi m\u1ed9t l\u00e1 th\u01b0 g\u1eedi \`C\u00f4 Tr\u1ea7n Ng\u1ecdc, nhi\u1ebfp \u1ea3nh gia\`. L\u00e1 th\u01b0 c\u1ee7a ch\u00ednh c\u00f4 b\u00e9 \u0111\u00e3 ph\u1ea3i \u0111i qua ba \u0111\u1ecba ch\u1ec9 m\u1edbi t\u00ecm \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c ch\u00fa S\u01a1n. \`Ng\u1ecdc th\u00e2n m\u1ebfn,\` ch\u00fa vi\u1ebft, \`ch\u00fa \u0111\u00e3 \u0111\u1ecdc th\u01b0 c\u1ee7a ch\u00e1u m\u01b0\u1eddi l\u1ea7n. Ch\u00fa c\u1ee9 t\u01b0\u1edfng trong ng\u00f4i nh\u00e0 \u1ea5y ch\u1eb3ng c\u00f2n ai mu\u1ed1n nghe t\u00ean ch\u00fa n\u1eefa. C\u00f4 g\u00e1i t\u1ed1t b\u1ee5ng \u1edf v\u00f9ng n\u00fai gi\u1edd \u0111\u00e3 l\u00e0 v\u1ee3 ch\u00fa; chuy\u1ec7n t\u00ecnh c\u1ee7a c\u00f4 ch\u00fa \u0111\u00e3 b\u1ec1n \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c m\u01b0\u1eddi m\u1ed9t n\u0103m. B\u1ed1 ch\u00e1u ch\u01b0a bao gi\u1edd ch\u1ec9 l\u00e0 anh ru\u1ed9t c\u1ee7a ch\u00fa; anh \u1ea5y c\u00f2n l\u00e0 ng\u01b0\u1eddi b\u1ea1n th\u00e2n nh\u1ea5t c\u1ee7a ch\u00fa. Ch\u00fa kh\u00f4ng d\u00e1m h\u1ee9a \u0111i\u1ec1u g\u00ec. Nh\u01b0ng n\u1ebfu \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c, ch\u00e1u h\u00e3y gi\u1eef l\u1ea5y ch\u1ed7 tr\u1ed1ng \u1ea5y.\``},{`en`:`Ngoc [[took|take]] [[it]] [[to]] Grandpa, [[who]] [[stood|stand]] [[in]] [[front]] [[of]] [[the]] [[photos|photo]] [[of]] [[their]] [[ancestors|ancestor]]. \`[[You]] [[have]] [[inherited|inherit]] [[my]] [[love]] [[of]] [[stories|story]],\` [[he]] [[said|say]], \`[[and]] [[one]] [[day]] [[you]] [[will]] [[inherit]] [[the]] [[stories|story]] [[too]]. [[But]] [[this]] [[one]] [[has|have]] [[had|have]] [[a]] [[hole]] [[in]] [[it]] [[for]] [[eleven]] [[years|year]].\` [[He]] [[took|take]] [[the]] [[old]] [[letter]] [[out]] [[of]] [[the]] [[wooden]] [[box]]. \`[[It]] [[is|be]] [[time]] [[your]] [[father]] [[read]] [[them]] [[both]].\``,`vn`:`Ng\u1ecdc mang th\u01b0 t\u1edbi cho \u00f4ng, l\u00fac \u1ea5y \u0111ang \u0111\u1ee9ng tr\u01b0\u1edbc di \u1ea3nh t\u1ed5 ti\u00ean. \`Ch\u00e1u \u0111\u00e3 th\u1eeba h\u01b0\u1edfng c\u00e1i t\u00ednh m\u00ea chuy\u1ec7n c\u1ee7a \u00f4ng,\` \u00f4ng n\u00f3i, \`r\u1ed3i m\u1ed9t ng\u00e0y ch\u00e1u s\u1ebd th\u1eeba h\u01b0\u1edfng c\u1ea3 nh\u1eefng c\u00e2u chuy\u1ec7n n\u1eefa. Nh\u01b0ng c\u00e2u chuy\u1ec7n n\u00e0y \u0111\u00e3 th\u1ee7ng m\u1ed9t l\u1ed7 su\u1ed1t m\u01b0\u1eddi m\u1ed9t n\u0103m r\u1ed3i.\` \u00d4ng l\u1ea5y l\u00e1 th\u01b0 c\u0169 trong chi\u1ebfc h\u1ed9p g\u1ed7 ra. \`\u0110\u00e3 \u0111\u1ebfn l\u00fac b\u1ed1 ch\u00e1u \u0111\u1ecdc c\u1ea3 hai l\u00e1.\``},{`en`:`[[Dad]] [[read]] [[them]] [[at]] [[the]] [[kitchen]] [[table]] [[after]] [[work]]. [[He]] [[was|be]] [[not]] [[his]] [[usual]] [[self]] [[that]] [[evening]]: [[he]] [[read]] [[the]] [[old]] [[letter]] [[three]] [[times|time]] [[and]] [[said|say]] [[nothing]]. Grandpa's [[elderly]] [[sister]] [[sat|sit]] [[down]] [[beside]] [[him]]. \`[[After]] [[my]] [[divorce]], [[I]] [[was|be]] [[too]] [[proud]] [[to]] [[come]] [[home]] [[for]] [[two]] [[years|year]],\` [[she]] [[said|say]]. \`[[Your]] [[father]] [[never]] [[stopped|stop]] [[writing]] [[to]] [[me]]. [[The]] [[bond]] [[between]] [[siblings|sibling]] [[is|be]] [[stronger|strong]] [[than]] [[any]] [[argument]].\` [[Dad]] [[put]] [[the]] [[old]] [[letter]] [[in]] [[his]] [[shirt]] [[pocket]].`,`vn`:`B\u1ed1 \u0111\u1ecdc hai l\u00e1 th\u01b0 b\u00ean b\u00e0n b\u1ebfp sau gi\u1edd l\u00e0m. T\u1ed1i h\u00f4m \u1ea5y b\u1ed1 ch\u1eb3ng c\u00f2n l\u00e0 m\u00ecnh c\u1ee7a m\u1ecdi ng\u00e0y: b\u1ed1 \u0111\u1ecdc l\u00e1 th\u01b0 c\u0169 ba l\u1ea7n v\u00e0 kh\u00f4ng n\u00f3i m\u1ed9t l\u1eddi. Ng\u01b0\u1eddi em g\u00e1i cao tu\u1ed5i c\u1ee7a \u00f4ng ng\u1ed3i xu\u1ed1ng c\u1ea1nh b\u1ed1. \`H\u1ed3i m\u1edbi ly h\u00f4n, c\u00f4 s\u0129 di\u1ec7n qu\u00e1 n\u00ean hai n\u0103m tr\u1eddi kh\u00f4ng v\u1ec1 nh\u00e0,\` b\u00e0 n\u00f3i. \`B\u1ed1 ch\u00e1u th\u00ec ch\u01b0a bao gi\u1edd ng\u1eebng vi\u1ebft th\u01b0 cho c\u00f4. T\u00ecnh anh ch\u1ecb em ru\u1ed9t b\u1ec1n h\u01a1n b\u1ea5t c\u1ee9 tr\u1eadn c\u00e3i nhau n\u00e0o.\` B\u1ed1 c\u1ea5t l\u00e1 th\u01b0 c\u0169 v\u00e0o t\u00fai \u00e1o s\u01a1 mi.`},{`en`:`[[On]] [[Saturday]] [[evening]], Bin [[was|be]] [[guarding|guard]] [[the]] [[gate]] [[with]] [[a]] [[wooden]] [[spoon]]. [[Down]] [[the]] [[street]], [[a]] [[small]] [[light]] [[was|be]] [[already]] [[burning|burn]] [[in]] an [[upstairs]] [[window]] [[of]] [[the]] [[house]] [[with]] [[the]] [[blue]] [[door]]. [[A]] [[tall]] [[man]] [[with]] [[a]] [[small]] [[bag]] [[stopped|stop]] [[outside]]. \`[[ID]], [[please]],\` [[said|say]] Bin. [[The]] [[stranger]] [[gave|give]] [[a]] [[shy]] [[smile]] [[and]] [[held|hold]] [[out]] [[a]] [[card]]. Ngoc [[read]] [[the]] [[ID]] [[over]] Bin's [[shoulder]]: \`Tran Son. [[Gender]]: [[male]].\` [[Then]] [[she]] [[looked|look]] [[at]] [[his]] [[nose]]. [[It]] [[was|be]] [[Dad's|dad]] [[nose]]. [[Behind]] [[her]], [[the]] [[kitchen]] [[door]] [[opened|open]], [[and]] [[her]] [[father]] [[stood|stand]] [[there]] [[with]] [[the]] [[letter]] [[in]] [[his]] [[pocket]]. [[Neither]] [[brother]] [[said|say]] [[a]] [[word]].`,`vn`:`T\u1ed1i th\u1ee9 B\u1ea3y, Bin c\u1ea7m m\u1ed9t chi\u1ebfc th\u00eca g\u1ed7 \u0111\u1ee9ng g\u00e1c c\u1ed5ng. Cu\u1ed1i ph\u1ed1, m\u1ed9t \u00e1nh \u0111\u00e8n nh\u1ecf \u0111\u00e3 s\u00e1ng \u1edf m\u1ed9t \u00f4 c\u1eeda s\u1ed5 t\u1ea7ng tr\u00ean c\u1ee7a ng\u00f4i nh\u00e0 c\u1eeda xanh. M\u1ed9t ng\u01b0\u1eddi \u0111\u00e0n \u00f4ng cao, x\u00e1ch chi\u1ebfc t\u00fai nh\u1ecf, d\u1eebng l\u1ea1i b\u00ean ngo\u00e0i. \`Cho xem c\u0103n c\u01b0\u1edbc \u1ea1,\` Bin n\u00f3i. Ng\u01b0\u1eddi l\u1ea1 m\u1ec9m c\u01b0\u1eddi b\u1ebdn l\u1ebdn r\u1ed3i ch\u00eca ra m\u1ed9t t\u1ea5m th\u1ebb. Ng\u1ecdc \u0111\u1ecdc t\u1ea5m c\u0103n c\u01b0\u1edbc qua vai Bin: \`Tr\u1ea7n S\u01a1n. Gi\u1edbi t\u00ednh: Nam.\` R\u1ed3i c\u00f4 b\u00e9 nh\u00ecn c\u00e1i m\u0169i c\u1ee7a ng\u01b0\u1eddi l\u1ea1. \u0110\u00f3 l\u00e0 c\u00e1i m\u0169i c\u1ee7a b\u1ed1. Sau l\u01b0ng c\u00f4 b\u00e9, c\u1eeda b\u1ebfp m\u1edf ra, v\u00e0 b\u1ed1 \u0111\u1ee9ng \u0111\u00f3, l\u00e1 th\u01b0 v\u1eabn n\u1eb1m trong t\u00fai \u00e1o. Hai anh em kh\u00f4ng ai n\u00f3i m\u1ed9t l\u1eddi.`}],`tease`:`Sau m\u01b0\u1eddi m\u1ed9t n\u0103m, hai anh em s\u1ebd n\u00f3i v\u1edbi nhau c\u00e2u g\u00ec \u0111\u1ea7u ti\u00ean?`}]}